 "own_rule_reading": [
  "trading days = the master's own day_id sessions (prereg: 'determined by day_id session dates'), so CME holiday half-sessions in the master (e.g. Memorial Day, Thanksgiving) COUNT as trading days and a master data gap (2014-12-31) does not",
  "calendar month = ET date of the session's first bar; a session qualifies when fewer than 3 later master sessions share its year-month (3 per month, 73 months, 219 trades)",
  "entry = open of the session's FIRST bar (the 09:30 start-stamped bar), filled at that open, no signal-bar delay (the decision is calendar-only, known before the session)",
  "exit = close of the session's LAST bar (15:55 bar = 16:00 ET on full days; the session's own last bar on half-days)",
  "long 1 contract, no stop, no target, no intrabar exit, flat overnight: each of the 3 days is its own trade",
  "the first (partial) month June 2010 and the last month June 2016 both end inside the window, so both get 3 trades",
  "only calendar knowledge is used; the master-session calendar differs from an ex-ante scheduled calendar on 3 trades (Sandy closure 2012-10-25/26 picked ex-post; 2014-12-26 picked because 2014-12-31 is a data gap) - see B_sensitivity"
 ],
